      "text": "2. The Executive Secretary to the Mayor in charge of public information service shall report directly to the Mayor, but that officer shall be responsible to the Deputy Mayor for the Executive Office, for supervision and for conforming with the procedure outlined in Paragraph \"B\" above.",
